{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/319c53967d71a0066ff4440cf2c638d4.poster.avif?t=1754570221\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/319c53967d71a0066ff4440cf2c638d4.webm?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/319c53967d71a0066ff4440cf2c638d4.mp4?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the office life of your dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet your coworkers and your manager. Perform your shift efficiently so the company runs smoothly because above all, this is your job, and your job is what represents you. Don\u2019t disappoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/2690b2b0b28c04d2ee3ac361eb2d7d24.poster.avif?t=1754570221\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/2690b2b0b28c04d2ee3ac361eb2d7d24.webm?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/2690b2b0b28c04d2ee3ac361eb2d7d24.mp4?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your work matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clients must be compensated, but choose wisely who you accept, as some won\u2019t hesitate to commit fraud. Allrisk Solutions also has its say. A manual is at your disposal to help you turn away as many clients as possible and ensure the prosperity of this company.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/9ce03cda9b24fdbe37f9023b28c27b7f.poster.avif?t=1754570221\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/9ce03cda9b24fdbe37f9023b28c27b7f.webm?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/9ce03cda9b24fdbe37f9023b28c27b7f.mp4?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home sweet home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The home is a place of rest, disconnect from the constant buzz of the office. Keep up with your household routine and return fresh and clean, ready for a brand new day of work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/599f728af0c649a6d05cacce33f3ba8a.poster.avif?t=1754570221\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/599f728af0c649a6d05cacce33f3ba8a.webm?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895130/extras/599f728af0c649a6d05cacce33f3ba8a.mp4?t=1754570221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No mystery whatsoever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company hides nothing from its employees. Do your job, and everything will be just fine.</p>","backgrou